  "pseudocode": "Freeze configuration, five arms, validation opportunities, sampling policy, and compute caps before search.\nFor each category and arm:\n    Initialize baseline with seed 42 and preserve preprocessing seed 0.\n    For branch arms: alpha=0; gate weights/bias=0; raw_decay=raw_strength=0.\n    For each training batch:\n        h = baseline.log2feats(sequence)\n        For each valid causal position t:\n            W = last at most 10 nonpadding observed positions through t\n            values = baseline input-scaled item vectors for W\n            cosine_vectors = normalize(stopgrad(values))\n            For j in W:\n                predecessors = {k in W: k < j}\n                support_j = mean(relu(cosine(j,k))) over predecessors, or 0\n                For popularity-control arm, residualize each cosine as specified before averaging.\n                a_j = -softplus(raw_decay)*(t-j) + softplus(raw_strength)*support_j\n                For recency-only arm, omit support_j term.\n            pool = sum(masked_softmax(a)_j * values_j), or zero for empty W\n            gate = sigmoid(linear([h_t, pool, log1p(valid_prefix_length)]))\n            z_t = h_t + alpha*gate*pool\n            For loss-only arm, z_t = h_t.\n            eligible = catalog minus padding, target_t, and observed prefix IDs\n            m = min(64, size(eligible))\n            If m == 0: skip row\n            negatives = uniform unique sample of size m from eligible\n            logits = unchanged_item_scores(z_t, [target_t]+negatives) / 1.0\n            row_loss = -log_softmax(logits)[0]\n        Optimize mean(row_loss) over retained rows; skip empty batches.\n        Unchanged-baseline arm instead uses its original loss and sampling.\n    Evaluate only at predeclared opportunities using pinned validation.\n    Record runtime, epochs, diagnostics, configuration, and available per-user hits.\nSelect by four-category macro validation HR@10 with declared tie-breaking.\nCompute paired us