Reflection 1: current report is not sufficient because ['Prefix extraction and 
user attribution are underspecified. The loader provides no user IDs, yet 
aggregation requires them. Each positive must be paired with its corresponding 
causal prefix, excluding later sequence positions, with explicit feature 
selection and candidate-scoring tensor shapes.', 'Exact-item recurrence may have
little coverage after preprocessing and does not measure repeated interests 
across different items. Define repetition eligibility, grouping rules, removal 
